# Build artifacts
*.o
*.d
*.a
bm
bm_test
vowel_demo
speak_demo
mkdict
bencmouth-gui
*.wasm
*.exe

# Generated by `make dict` from ref/cmudict-0.7b.txt - ~1.5 MB of C,
# fully reproducible, so the input is committed and the output is not.
src/core/bm_dict_data.c

# Generated audio. Rendered output is reproducible from the source that made
# it, so it does not belong in history - regenerate with `make demo && ./vowel_demo`.
render/

# Reference material is checked in deliberately (see ref/README.md), but the
# dictionary is 3.5 MB. If that becomes a nuisance, the compiled form produced
# by tools/mkdict is what the build actually needs.

# OS cruft
.DS_Store
._*

# Brand/style assets, kept out of the public repo
style/

# Generated from assets/ by tools/mkembed.c, like the dictionary data.
src/gui/bm_embed.c
mkembed

# What the release job assembles for makensis, out of files that are already
# either committed or built. The setup .exe itself is covered by *.exe above.
stage/

# CLAP headers, fetched by `make clap-fetch`. MIT, and a tagged download rather
# than a submodule for the reason the dictionary is not checked in: it is an
# input the build can reproduce, not something this project maintains.
vendor/
build/
